  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multimodal models with multiprofile, scvi_n200 RNA encoder, resnet50 image encoder, transformer aggregation, and weighted fusion (config_033) achieve the highest accuracy. This experiment tests whether replacing the image encoder with imagenet_vit_l (a more advanced model) while keeping other parameters fixed (scvi_n200 RNA, transformer aggregation, weighted fusion) improves performance. This isolates the effect of the image encoder choice, a critical design decision, and addresses uncertainty about whether more complex image encoders outperform resnet50 in this context."
}

